#. Description of the plugin
#: od-ai-content.php
msgid "Delivers WordPress content as Markdown that is easier for AI systems to retrieve and understand."
msgstr "WordPressコンテンツを、AIが取得・理解しやすいMarkdownとして配信します。"

#. Author of the plugin
